%rec: journalEntry
%key: id


id: tutorial
name: Grim's legacy
skill_points: 2
#
start_cond: !HasItem('home_keys')
start_text:
+ Grim, your old friend and fellow contractor, wants to retire.
+ He promised to leave you his apartment keys.
#
prog_cond: HasItem('home_keys')
prog_text: You should check out Grim's apartment.
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Killed(grim_beard)')
end_id: grim_dead
end_text: Grim is dead. His legacy is yours now.

### Main Quest Line ###

id: to_the_stars
name: To The Stars
skill_points: 10
perk_points: 1
#
start_cond: HasFlag('KnowsAbout(golden_ticket)')
start_text:
+ You want to leave this place and go to the stars.
+ Word on the street is that 1 million sat will get you there.
+ You need to find a way to get that kind of money.
#
end_cond: HasFlag('KnowsAbout(ticket_scam)')
end_text: The ships leave without passengers. Nobody buys a way to the stars.
end_id: scam
end_skill_points: 0

### Starter Quest ###

id: starter
name: Medical Extortion
skill_points: 5
#
start_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(starter)')
start_text: Jacob wants you to extract 500 Sat from the Ripperdoc in the northside residential area.
#
start_cond: HasFlag('JobDeclined(starter)')
start_text: You turned down Jacob's job. Someone else will take it.
#
# Alternative Start: find Drake first
#
start_cond: HasFlag('TalkedTo(drake_gallows)') && !HasFlag('drake_freed')
start_text: Drake Gallows, the original Ripperdoc, is locked away in the cellar of the hospital.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('ContainerRemoved(jacob_safe, gold)')
prog_text: You cleaned out Jacob's safe. Funny thought: he would never know if his own money showed up in the dead drop.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('WorkFor(daniel_harker)')
prog_text: You agreed to keep Doc Harker safe from Jacob. Jacob lives in the eastern residential district.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('starter(money_collected)') || HasFlag('ContainerRemoved(ripperdoc_stash, gold)')
prog_text: You have the money. Deposit 250 Sat in the dead drop, or hand it to Jacob yourself.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('drake_freed')
prog_text: You have freed Drake Gallows, the Ripperdoc that was locked away in the cellar of the hospital.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('Killed(daniel_harker)')
prog_text: Daniel Harker, is dead. Jacob will still want his money though.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('LocationKnown(jacobs_home)')
prog_text: Jacob lives in the eastern residential district. Maybe there is more to be had from him.
#
end_cond: HasFlag('ContainerRemoved(jacob_safe, gold)') && HasFlag('ClientRewardReceived(starter)')
end_text: You paid Jacob with his own money, and he paid you for it. Beautiful.
end_id: paid_with_clients_money
end_skill_points: 10
#
end_cond: HasFlag('ClientRewardReceived(starter)')
end_text: You have received your payment from Jacob.
end_id: reward_received
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Killed(jacob_thorne)') && HasFlag('WorkFor(daniel_harker)')
end_text: Jacob is dead. Dr. Harker, will be pleased to hear about it.
end_id: killed_client_for_daniel
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Killed(jacob_thorne)')
end_text: Your client is dead. So no payment for you.
end_id: killed_client
#
end_cond: HasFlag('jacob_backed_off')
end_text: Jacob called off the job. The Doc is safe, for now.
end_id: client_backed_off
#
end_cond: HasFlag('starter(client_extorted)')
end_text: Jacob paid you to go away. Not the deal he had in mind.
end_id: client_extorted
#
end_cond: HasFlag('JobDeclined(starter)') && HasFlag('starter(other_assassin_done)')
end_text: Jacob found someone else for the job. Quinn Rix did it his way.
end_id: job_lost
end_skill_points: 0



### Side Quests ###
### Chapter 1 ###

id: find_mansion
name: The Mansion
skill_points: 6
perk_points: 1
#
start_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(mansion)') || HasFlag('LocationKnown(mansion)')
start_text:
+ Somebody rich is hiding in a mansion outside the wall. Nobody knows where.
+ Somebody always knows: the gate watch logs what leaves, the taxi drivers drive it there,
+ and the caterers at Terra Vitae send their invoices.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('LocationKnown(mansion)')
prog_text: The mansion lies outside the wall. The taxi can take you there.
#
end_cond: HasFlag('TalkedTo(logan_faust)') || HasFlag('Killed(logan_faust)')
end_text: You found the mansion and the man hiding in it: Logan Faust.
end_id: found


### Chapter 2: the mansion ###

id: recluse
name: The Recluse
skill_points: 10
perk_points: 1
#
start_cond: HasFlag('TalkedTo(logan_faust)') || HasFlag('Killed(logan_faust)') || HasFlag('KnowsAbout(cryo_lab)') || HasFlag('faust_sold_out') || HasFlag('safe_cracked')
start_text:
+ Logan Faust, the man E. wants silenced, lives above something he values more than his life.
+ Find out what it is before you decide what he is worth.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('faust_persuade_failed')
prog_text: Faust wants proof you are not E.'s: the south gate's EBI log, or Mira's word.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('household_alert')
prog_text: Mira found the safe open. Faust's people shoot on sight now.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('faust_sold_out')
prog_text: You gave E. the address. 5000 sat, and a strike team on its way.
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Killed(logan_faust)')
end_text: Logan Faust is dead. Whatever he was hiding is yours to find.
end_id: faust_dead
#
end_cond: HasFlag('faust_warned')
end_text: You sold Faust to E., then ran back and sent him below before the rotors came. The 5000 sat is still yours. E. will not forget.
end_id: warned
#
end_cond: HasFlag('faust_sold_out')
end_text: You sold Faust to E. for 5000 sat. EBI troopers are on their way to the mansion.
end_id: sold_out
#
end_cond: HasFlag('faust_allied')
end_text: Faust trusted you with the keycard to his cryo lab and the truth about the golden ticket.
end_id: allied
#
end_cond: HasFlag('faust_extorted')
end_text: Faust paid you 2000 sat and the keycard to make you go away. He told you about the lab anyway.
end_id: extorted

### Chapter 3: the cryo lab ###

id: cryo
name: The Long Sleep
skill_points: 20
perk_points: 1
#
start_cond: HasFlag('KnowsAbout(cryo_lab)')
start_text:
+ Under Faust's mansion is a cryo lab with four pods. When the sky burns, the sleepers wake afterwards.
+ Get a pod that is empty and works. Or sell the place to the people who want it buried.
#
prog_cond: HasFlag('PodFree(1)') || HasFlag('PodFree(2)') || HasFlag('PodFixed(3)') || HasFlag('PodFree(4)') || HasFlag('Killed(logan_faust)')
prog_text: A pod in the lab is free and working. Climb in when you are ready.
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Ending(cryo_sleep)') && HasFlag('sleeper_moved')
end_text:
+ The lid seals. Two pods down, Henrik Vale sleeps on in the berth you fixed for him; he will never know he moved.
+ Somewhere above, the pulse hits: every light in Edge Haven dies at once, and then the sky catches fire.
+ Nobody died for your cold. Two hundred years. To be continued.
end_id: cryo_sleep_clean
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Ending(cryo_sleep)')
end_text:
+ The lid seals. ARK counts you down in a voice like a kind nurse.
+ Somewhere above, the pulse hits: every light in Edge Haven dies at once, and then the sky catches fire.
+ You don't see it. You are already cold.
+ One locker, one item, two hundred years. To be continued.
end_id: cryo_sleep
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Ending(against_all_odds)')
end_text:
+ The files hit every public terminal in the city before EBI cut the lines.
+ The broadcast drew the grid down; behind you the pods thawed, and Vale and Marrow died without waking.
+ The troopers came down the cellar stairs in pairs. You made them pay for every step.
+ By morning your name is painted on the wall of the spaceport and the ships still leave without passengers.
+ You died famous. Nobody ever bought a way to the stars.
end_id: against_all_odds
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Ending(sold_lab)')
end_text:
+ 50000 sat. EBI poured the cellar full of concrete the same night, sleepers and all.
+ You were rich for a week. You bought the good whiskey and a view of the sky.
+ The pulse took the lights. The fire took the rest.
end_id: sold_lab
#
end_cond: HasFlag('Ending(gave_up)')
end_text:
+ You spent it on the roof. Good food, bad company, the whole skyline for an audience.
+ The night the ships lifted, the stars came down to meet them.
+ You watched the sky burn with a drink in your hand. It was, all things considered, a decent seat.
end_id: gave_up
end_skill_points: 0
